    <span style="color:var(--sm-cream-dim)">· No gums or fillers</span>
    <span style="color:var(--sm-cream-dim)">· Veteran-owned</span>
    <span style="color:var(--sm-cream-dim)">· Ships next day</span>
  </div>
</section>

