      <blockquote style="margin:16px 0 20px; font-family:var(--sm-f-body); font-size:20px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--sm-cream); font-style:italic">"The depth of flavor brings a gentle heat that is perfect on eggs, sandwiches, seafood, chicken, or probably anything!"</blockquote>
